# TIER 2 - saddle-point optimization + frequencies at the DFT level (cloud instance)
# Start from the Tier 1 saddle point of the same step. Calc_Hess gives the
# initial Hessian; the run must end with exactly ONE imaginary frequency.

! B3LYP D3BJ def2-SVP RIJCOSX TightSCF TightOpt DefGrid3 OptTS FREQ

%geom
  Calc_Hess true
end

%pal nprocs 12 end
%maxcore 4000

* xyzfile 0 1 t1_ts.xyz
